# Frontend

- Use Next.js App Router in `app/` only.
- Prefer Server Components; add `'use client'` only for forms, local state, dialogs, scanners, and browser APIs.
- Import shared types and schemas from `@meridian/shared`.
- Import shared UI from `@meridian/ui`; colocate feature-only components near routes in `_components` or app-local `components`.
- Fetch in Server Components with cookies forwarded to the API; use client fetch or server actions for mutations with user feedback.
- Use React Hook Form plus Zod schemas from `@meridian/shared` for forms when schemas exist.
- Middleware protects portal routes using the portal-specific auth cookie; keep JWT audiences separate.
- Use Tailwind utilities and design tokens; no inline styles for normal layout or colors.
- Empty, loading, error, and success states must match `packages/ui` patterns.
